  "prefLabel": "Rev 501.05 Excavating",
  "priorExpiration": "2011-03-31",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 501.05 \"Excavating\" means extracting earth from its state of natural repose by any method, such as dredging, blasting, digging out and removing, or forming a cavity or a hole in any land area. Excavating includes excavate.\n\nSource. #7381, eff 10-24-00; ss by #7860, eff 3-31-03, EXPIRED: 3-31-11\n\nNew. #9926, eff 5-18-11 (from Rev 501.04); ss by #12834, eff 7-25-19",
